/// Converts to S32, rounding toward zero.
/// :returns: The integer part of `self`.
/// :throws: Crashes with `IntegerOverflowError` when `self` is NaN or its integer part lies outside [-2^31, 2^31 - 1]. The crash reports the caller's location.
/// :see: {F32.to_checked<S32>} to get an absent value instead, {F32.to_clamp<S32>} to saturate.
